WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.458
In verse 16.8,

2
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:48.333
Lord Krishna described

3
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.375
the demoniac worldview –

4
00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:52.541
one that denies God,

5
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:54.291
scripture, and the moral

6
00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:57.041
foundation of creation.

7
00:00:57.041 --> 00:01:00.750
Now in verses 16.9 and 16.10,

8
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.291
He focuses on the effects

9
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.458
of this mindset.

10
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:07.291
He explains the devastating

11
00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:10.250
consequences of these distorted beliefs.

12
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.333
Those who deny the truth of scripture

13
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:20.875
and take refuge in sensual thinking

14
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:24.083
lose their spiritual identity.

15
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:27.500
Lord Krishna calls them nashtaatma,

16
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.208
because they know themselves not as a soul,

17
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:34.083
but only as a body.

18
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:36.666
Lacking spiritual vision,

19
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:39.333
they are called alpabuddhi.

20
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:40.958
Their thinking is limited only

21
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:44.041
to material and temporary gain.

22
00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:47.375
Such people are ugrakarmana.

23
00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:48.500
Engaged in extremely

24
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.583
cruel and destructive actions,

25
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:54.500
they consider animal slaughter as progress,

26
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.375
build exploitative industries,

27
00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:59.958
create weapons of mass destruction.

28
00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:02.875
They invent such technologies

29
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:04.916
that destroy nature

30
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:07.041
and forge such ideologies

31
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:10.041
that confuse morality.

32
00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:13.375
Their conduct neither lifts society,

33
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:15.000
nor themselves.

34
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.041
So they are jagatohitah.

35
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:19.833
Enemies of the world,

36
00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:23.208
who lead society toward destruction.

37
00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:25.291
Then in verse 16.10, Lord Krishna

38
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:27.958
reveals the root of this behaviour.

39
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:30.541
These people take shelter in kamam ashritya,

40
00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:33.875
that is, insatiable desires.

41
00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:36.833
Instead of taking shelter in dharma or God,

42
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:40.291
they become slaves of their own desires.

43
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:43.625
Pride and delusion surround them.

44
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.958
They are ashuchivrata,

45
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.625
that is, they mistake impure resolves

46
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:49.958
for spiritual practice

47
00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:51.541
and call distorted

48
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:54.750
conduct freedom or progress.

49
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:59.250
They hold on to asadgrahan,
that is, false pleasures,

50
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.208
and treat them as real.

51
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.750
In this way their entire life is spent

52
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.958
searching for satisfaction on the wrong path.

53
00:03:07.958 --> 00:03:12.375
This search arises from ego and delusion.

54
00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:15.958
These false ideas spread dangerously

55
00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:17.041
and become destructive

56
00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:20.208
for culture and society.

57
00:03:25.125 --> 00:03:29.250
Today's world often says –

58
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.583
‘To truly live,

59
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:35.041
do what feels good.

60
00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:39.666
More comfort, more experience,
more pleasure.’

61
00:03:39.666 --> 00:03:44.333
But those who take shelter in desires

62
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:48.000
and consider that progress,

63
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.875
slowly

64
00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:53.000
lose themselves.

65
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.875
They think they are free,

66
00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:58.416
but in reality

67
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:02.083
they remain bound by their own desires.

68
00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:04.916
True freedom does not mean

69
00:04:04.916 --> 00:04:08.083
fulfilling every craving.

70
00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:11.250
That is only another form of slavery,

71
00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.416
one that may look appealing, but

72
00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:19.291
ultimately empties you from within.

73
00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:20.125
When life

74
00:04:20.125 --> 00:04:22.416
revolves only around immediate

75
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:25.875
pleasures, then lasting

76
00:04:25.875 --> 00:04:29.625
peace disappears from view.

77
00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:34.708
You replace purpose with thrill,

78
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:40.250
but the heart still remains restless.

79
00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.583
This is not living,

80
00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:45.416
this is only running.

81
00:04:45.416 --> 00:04:48.791
Remember, your existence

82
00:04:48.791 --> 00:04:51.666
is not from your impulses,

83
00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:55.125
nor from your desires.

84
00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:57.583
You are a soul.

85
00:04:57.583 --> 00:05:01.000
Return to that identity.

86
00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.166
Do not let society

87
00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:06.708
define your freedom.

88
00:05:06.708 --> 00:05:11.666
Define it with Me.

89
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:14.916
Through self-mastery, through clarity,

90
00:05:14.916 --> 00:05:18.083
and through devotion.

91
00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:21.333
This is real freedom.

92
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.833
In today's world, often

93
00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:32.125
wrong role models are celebrated,

94
00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:35.000
those who make the most noise,

95
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.958
gather the most wealth, and treat indulgence

96
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:41.708
as life itself.

97
00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:46.125
But remember, those who deny truth

98
00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:51.041
and take shelter in desires ultimately

99
00:05:51.041 --> 00:05:54.666
become enemies of society.

100
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:59.000
And when families remain silent,

101
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.625
children

102
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:04.375
learn this from the outside world.

103
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:07.125
Today you can see –

104
00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:09.791
a flood of motivational speakers

105
00:06:09.791 --> 00:06:12.416
and AI-generated images

106
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:15.833
and videos has arrived.

107
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:20.916
Every moment, false information spreads,

108
00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:23.500
covering the sun of true knowledge

109
00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.416
like clouds.

110
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.041
In such times, it is vital to teach

111
00:06:30.041 --> 00:06:33.916
children how to distinguish

112
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:38.166
between right and wrong sources,

113
00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:43.000
so they are not confused and led astray.

114
00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:48.166
And when families stay silent,

115
00:06:48.166 --> 00:06:48.958
children

116
00:06:48.958 --> 00:06:52.916
absorb this from the outside world.

117
00:06:52.916 --> 00:06:56.916
If you do not teach them values,

118
00:06:56.916 --> 00:07:00.250
society will teach them shortcuts

119
00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.833
and self-interest.

120
00:07:02.833 --> 00:07:08.083
If you do not model self-discipline,

121
00:07:08.083 --> 00:07:11.041
misleading screen content

122
00:07:11.041 --> 00:07:14.125
will show them the attraction of indulgence.

123
00:07:14.125 --> 00:07:16.416
And result?

124
00:07:16.416 --> 00:07:20.375
Confused minds, weak character,

125
00:07:20.375 --> 00:07:23.875
and hollow relationships.

126
00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:28.333
Your home is their first school.

127
00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:32.625
Show them that real strength is not in control,

128
00:07:32.625 --> 00:07:35.333
but in discipline.

129
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:40.250
Teach them that success without integrity

130
00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:45.083
ultimately proves to be failure.

131
00:07:45.083 --> 00:07:47.875
So speak

132
00:07:47.875 --> 00:07:52.916
of truth, of fairness, and of devotion.

133
00:07:52.916 --> 00:07:56.041
Not only of achievements.

134
00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:58.875
When you teach children to live

135
00:07:58.875 --> 00:08:02.041
a life based on dharma,

136
00:08:02.041 --> 00:08:05.750
they stand firm even

137
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.708
when the whole world is shaking.

138
00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:17.666
In the name of progress, many people

139
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:21.916
cross their own boundaries. But

140
00:08:21.916 --> 00:08:24.708
when work is cut off from truth

141
00:08:24.708 --> 00:08:28.000
and spirituality,

142
00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.541
and driven only by selfish shade,

143
00:08:31.541 --> 00:08:35.625
that very work becomes destructive.

144
00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:40.666
Even if it looks like progress from the outside.

145
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:43.791
Such a perspective may look bold,

146
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:48.458
but its roots are very entangled.

147
00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:53.166
When sanctity leaves an organisation,

148
00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:56.791
progress loses its light.

149
00:08:56.791 --> 00:09:00.958
Culture becomes impure, trust

150
00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:02.833
begins to weaken,

151
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:06.250
and purpose begins to go astray.

152
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.125
Setting aside ethics,

153
00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:11.041
exploiting others,

154
00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:13.916
or damaging the environment,

155
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.458
all of these may seem immediately profitable.

156
00:09:17.458 --> 00:09:22.166
But they break those rules

157
00:09:22.166 --> 00:09:28.083
that cannot easily be repaired later.

158
00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:32.291
True progress is that which lifts
not only the market,

159
00:09:32.291 --> 00:09:36.583
but also human beings.

160
00:09:36.583 --> 00:09:39.291
It considers consequences

161
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:42.916
and stands the test of time.

162
00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:46.041
So understand – do not consider

163
00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:50.208
speed the sign of meaningful progress.

164
00:09:50.208 --> 00:09:54.625
Before running in the race for more, pause.

165
00:09:54.625 --> 00:09:57.000
Ask yourself once more.

166
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.291
‘Does this race of mine align with truth?

167
00:10:01.291 --> 00:10:04.041
Does it benefit not only me,

168
00:10:04.041 --> 00:10:07.250
but others too?’

169
00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.291
So I say,

170
00:10:10.291 --> 00:10:13.291
build carefully,

171
00:10:13.291 --> 00:10:16.000
lead with integrity.

172
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.291
Guide your ambition with high values

173
00:10:19.291 --> 00:10:23.250
and a spirit of sincerity.

174
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.791
And when your progress

175
00:10:26.791 --> 00:10:29.958
honours sanctity,

176
00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:33.541
then I make it lasting.

177
00:10:33.541 --> 00:10:35.375
And that very progress

178
00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:40.166
carries the power to touch countless lives.

179
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:46.166
Do not take the path of untruth
even for immediate success.

180
00:10:46.166 --> 00:10:50.125
Always take the path of truth.

181
00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:51.125
That path

182
00:10:51.125 --> 00:10:55.291
will take you to the greatest destination,

183
00:10:55.291 --> 00:10:59.750
which is greater than any success.

184
00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.875
And that destination

185
00:11:02.875 --> 00:11:03.666
is Me.
